{"publishers": ["Simon & Schuster"], "number_of_pages": 333, "subtitle": "the collected stories and other writings", "ia_box_id": ["IA172901"], "covers": [473335], "local_id": ["urn:phillips:31867001232607", "urn:sfpl:31223060842060", "urn:sfpl:31223060842359", "urn:sfpl:31223099072499", "urn:sfpl:31223060842011", "urn:bwbsku:R1-AYR-631", "urn:nuls:31786101670484"], "ia_loaded_id": ["catchascatchcan00hell"], "lc_classifications": ["PS3558.E476 C38 2003"], "url": ["http://www.loc.gov/catdir/bios/simon053/2002042875.html", "http://www.loc.gov/catdir/description/simon033/2002042875.html"], "key": "/books/OL3566381M", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL33512A"}, {"key": "/authors/OL1143795A"}], "ocaid": "catchascatchcan00hell", "publish_places": ["New York"], "contributions": ["Bruccoli, Matthew Joseph, 1931-", "Bucker, Park."], "uri_descriptions": ["Contributor biographical information", "Publisher description"], "pagination": "xviii, 333 p. ;", "source_records": ["marc:marc_records_scriblio_net/part14.dat:35194033:862", "marc:marc_loc_updates/v36.i23.records.utf8:3586559:974", "marc:marc_ithaca_college/ic_marc.mrc:198227606:705", "ia:catchascatchcan00hell", "marc:marc_openlibraries_phillipsacademy/PANO_FOR_IA_05072019.mrc:85529458:1866", "marc:marc_openlibraries_sanfranciscopubliclibrary/sfpl_chq_2018_12_24_run03.mrc:17340068:2310", "marc:marc_loc_2016/BooksAll.2016.part29.utf8:201063069:974", "promise:bwb_daily_pallets_2020-10-07", "marc:marc_nuls/NULS_PHC_180925.mrc:97327151:1681", "marc:marc_columbia/Columbia-extract-20221130-007.mrc:427767972:2553", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.09.20150123.full.mrc:57739817:3347"], "title": "Catch as catch can", "lccn": ["2002042875"], "identifiers": {"goodreads": ["857041"], "librarything": ["529671"]}, "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "dewey_decimal_class": ["813/.54"], "isbn_10": ["0743243749"], "publish_date": "2003", "publish_country": "nyu", "by_statement": "Joseph Heller ; edited by Matthew J. Bruccoli and Park Bucker.", "works": [{"key": "/works/OL276793W"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "uris": ["http://www.loc.gov/catdir/bios/simon053/2002042875.html", "http://www.loc.gov/catdir/description/simon033/2002042875.html"], "oclc_numbers": ["51095413"], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "\"Of the stories in this collection, thirteen were written before 1961, when Catch-22 was published; of those, five have never before been published. After Catch-22, Heller forsook the short story form. Though five stories were published after 1961, one - \"World Full of Great Cities\" - was actually written in 1949, three of the other four are spin-offs of Catch-22, and one is a preview of Closing Time.\".\n\n\"Rounding out this collection of the complete published short writings of Joseph Heller are a short play and several nonfiction pieces, mostly related to Catch-22.\"--BOOK JACKET."}, "latest_revision": 18, "revision": 18, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2008-04-01T03:28:50.625462"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2024-08-23T03:33:47.903288"}}